{"c":[{"id":"90d7e5acee519c7f","sum":"Nap stems are five-part seq-leafset-grain-pair-digest; zipper keeps lex-greatest; migrate.py (operator-only, sibling-load by __file__) rewrites old stems. #61 supersedes #59; wake-never-cut archived as #60.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"820f42beb587e299","sum":"wake-never-cut archived (#60); Issue #61 added five-part nap stems with pair-byte variants; migrate.py is an operator-only surgery analogue.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T222443Z-9e0ebfff2047eda7","text":"wake-never-cut archived to memory-bank/archive/bug-fixes/20260825-wake-never-cut.md; draft PR #60.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T230722Z-c53313e27e6b7b27","text":"Issue #61 L3: five-part nap stems with pair-bytes variant tag; operator migrate.py is a surgery analogue, not a summem verb.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2ce00208bcbe0278","sum":"Nap stems are five-part seq-leafset-grain-pair-digest; zipper keeps lex-greatest; migrate rewrites old stems. nap-variant-stems QA: 346 tests. surgery.plan_break_out duplicates child-stem logic; migrate loads sibling summem by __file__ from cwd.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T001753Z-7316415cc5604024","text":"Nap stems are five-part {seq}-{leafset}-{grain}-{pair-digest}; git unions same-block variants; zipper keeps the lex-greatest; migrate.py rewrites four-part stores.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T002702Z-26707560339bbbf7","text":"QA PASS nap-variant-stems (346 tests py311-314). surgery.plan_break_out duplicates rematerialize_child's child-stem block with no test pinning them equal. migrate.py loads sibling summem by __file__ and takes its store from cwd.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cf83f26b93a1e0ab","sum":"Four-part nap stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch; driver lists five-part stems only and migrate.py is the only four-part reader; child_nap_stem names rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists git root only when .summem is a directory.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0f04308dc7e8c4c7","sum":"Nap-variant-stems: four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch; child_nap_stem names rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists git root only when .summem is a directory.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T003014Z-adbfa7448201be34","text":"Nap-variant-stems reflected: QA PASS, 346 tests; a four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T004034Z-6b4ff0568eccf9a6","text":"child_nap_stem is the shared serialize-then-name path for rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists the git root only when .summem is a directory.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8ebfa75808b2336c","sum":"Driver lists five-part nap stems only; migrate.py is the only four-part reader.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T004244Z-cbe9baa615b860a5","text":"PR #62 is the five-part nap-stem draft; closes #61 and supersedes #59.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T005232Z-a1d8ce977ef75db8","text":"Clean break: driver lists five-part nap stems only; migrate.py is the only four-part reader.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
